// The nine Formulae (Insight, cast with a stylus). Source: docs/game/04-arsenal-and-builds.md,
// "Formulae (Insight, stylus)", and docs/game/03-combat.md, "Spells". Schema:
// crates/content/src/spells.rs. Each spell carries its own cast moves, projectiles, and buffs;
// the loader merges them into the move, projectile, and buff tables, so none of them is in
// moves/, projectiles.ron, or status.ron. FP costs are the moves' `fp`.
//
// Registry numbers: spells 15000-15019, moves 15100-15149, projectiles 15300-15349, and buffs
// 15400-15449 are the Formulae's. The upper halves of each block (15020+, 15150+, 15350+,
// 15450+) are the Litanies'.
//
// Every number marked "tuning" is a first guess; the spec gives only the FP cost, slots,
// requirement, and effect of each Formula.
#![enable(implicit_some)]
(
  rules: (
    // docs/game/03-combat.md, "Spells": Finesse shortens cast startup by up to 25 percent at
